        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Antioch</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">300 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">Founded by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/seleucus-i-nicator">Seleucus I Nicator</a> in 300 BCE, after his victory at Ipsus in 301 BCE; John Malalas gives 22 May 300 BCE for his sacrifice to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zeus">Zeus</a> at the site.</span></div>
